    {
      "id": "patterns-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 58,
      "y": 678,
      "width": 210,
      "height": 264,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#cccccc",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "text": "✦ Event-Driven Architecture\n  Worker pub/sub → Socket.io\n\n✦ Multi-Tenant Isolation\n  Workspace-scoped JWT claims\n\n✦ DAG Execution Engine\n  Kahn's Topological Sort\n  Cycle detection on save\n\n✦ Worker Pool Pattern\n  BullMQ concurrency=10\n  Dead Letter Queue\n\n✦ Redis Caching\n  Workflow definitions 5m TTL\n  Read-through invalidation\n\n✦ Refresh Token Rotation\n  Secure sliding sessions\n\n✦ Rate Limiting\n  Per-IP + Auth endpoint",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "✦ Event-Driven Architecture\n  Worker pub/sub → Socket.io\n\n✦ Multi-Tenant Isolation\n  Workspace-scoped JWT claims\n\n✦ DAG Execution Engine\n  Kahn's Topological Sort\n  Cycle detection on save\n\n✦ Worker Pool Pattern\n  BullMQ concurrency=10\n  Dead Letter Queue\n\n✦ Redis Caching\n  Workflow definitions 5m TTL\n  Read-through invalidation\n\n✦ Refresh Token Rotation\n  Secure sliding sessions\n\n✦ Rate Limiting\n  Per-IP + Auth endpoint"
    },
