      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "text": "1. POST /workflows/:id/execute\n2. Create Execution record (QUEUED)\n3. Enqueue BullMQ Job\n4. Worker picks up job\n5. Topological sort nodes\n6. Execute nodes in order:\n   → HTTP / Transform / AI / etc.\n7. Redis pub/sub → Socket.io\n8. Client receives live updates\n9. Final status → PostgreSQL",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. POST /workflows/:id/execute\n2. Create Execution record (QUEUED)\n3. Enqueue BullMQ Job\n4. Worker picks up job\n5. Topological sort nodes\n6. Execute nodes in order:\n   → HTTP / Transform / AI / etc.\n7. Redis pub/sub → Socket.io\n8. Client receives live updates\n9. Final status → PostgreSQL"
